 34AR c  1974Be18: {+32}S({+3}He,n|g) with 8-MeV {+3}He beam from ANU EN tandem 
 34AR2c  accelerator impinging on cooled sulphur targets. Neutrons were detected
 34AR3c  using an NE213 liquid scintillator and |g rays were detected using a   
 34AR4c  Ge(Li) detector and a NaI(Tl) detector. Measured E|g, I|g, n|g-coin,   
 34AR5c  n|g(|q). Deduced levels, J, |g-ray branching ratios. Deduced lifetimes 
 34AR6c  for 4 levels using DSAM.                                               
 34AR c  1974Gr19: {+32}S({+3}He,n|g) with 8-12-MeV {+3}He beam from the 7-MV   
 34AR2c  Van de Graaff accelerator at the University of Freiburg impinging on   
 34AR3c  natural ZnS targets. Neutrons were detected using an annular NE213     
 34AR4c  liquid scintillator and |g rays were detected using a Ge(Li) detector  
 34AR5c  and 5 NaI(Tl) detectors. Measured E|g, I|g, n|g-coin, and n|g|g-coin.  
 34AR6c  Deduced 10 levels, J, |g-ray branching ratios, and mixing ratios.      
 34AR7c  Deduced lifetimes for 5 levels using DSAM.                             
 34AR c  1972Ca22: {+32}S({+3}He,n|g) with 8.5-MeV {+3}He beam from the Oxford  
 34AR2c  University tandem Van de Graaff generator impinging on Ag{-2}S targets.
 34AR3c  Neutrons were detected using a NE102 liquid scintillator. The |g rays  
 34AR4c  were detected using a Ge(Li) detector. Measured E|g, I|g, E{-n}, I{-n},
 34AR5c  and n|g(|q). Deduced lifetimes for 3 levels using DSAM.                
